<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24236" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῦτε</span></b> , Adv., as pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῦρο,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>come hither!</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> with pl. imper. (exc. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῦτ᾽ ἄγε Φαιήκων ἡγήτορες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.11
				</span></i>
			), either expressed, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῦτ᾽ ἄγετ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.350
				</span></i>
			, al.; or understood, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῦτε, φίλοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.481
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῦθ᾽, ἵνα . . ἴδησθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.30
				</span></i>
			: rarely in Lyr., <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				60
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				65
			</span></i>, and Trag., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῦτε, λείπετε στέγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					894
				</span></i>
			: in later Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. οἰκοδομήσωμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					11.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ἴδετε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					28.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. καὶ ἀκούσατε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					3.23.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cor.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			.</div>
